  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with Nature to Protect People - STREAM Ethiopia - ERCS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to come up with a well-thought/researched, replicable, home-grown (based on local experience), and marketable nature based solution programme proposal that will be implemented for next five to ten years. The programme is expected to enhance disaster risk reduction and climate change adaptation by replicating home grown NbS at a larger scale.</narrative>
  </description>
